# Conventional Commit Format
# <type>: <description>
#
# Types:
# feat: new feature
# fix: bug fix
# sec: security fix
# docs: documentation change
# refactor: code refactor
# test: add/update tests
# chore: maintenance

# Examples:
# feat: add firewall rule persistence
# fix: handle invalid CSR parsing
# sec: patch command injection in parser
# docs: update deployment instructions